      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善小姐托付给我，对我而言象征着“特别之物”\r\n的这份信念，才是最强大的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "732744d93d7b87660bc8e2aa8a140e8b873df9c15f36a7394697d41191bac388",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
