      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她低着头，静静地述说着自己的梦想。\r\n那是个简单的梦想——\r\n赢下重赏，让她的母亲为她骄傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95fc29a93b6c8dbae3e91271063d70ad038cde0bf723cc4638c02402f56f2774",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
