      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着，她向我发问了：\r\n『为了达成我的梦想，我可以不择手段。\r\n丸善同学，你的梦想又是什么呢？』",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f8f594f9cbbe19e77d061d997b486c14ea38b3bf403d7ee7169f04924260c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
